<title>ABU DHABI: UAE president pardons 100 prisoners.</title>
<headline>UAE president pardons 100 prisoners.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Arab Emirates President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan has pardoned 100 prisoners on the occassion of the Moslem fasting month of Ramadan, the official Emirates news agency reported.</p>
<p>It said late on Tuesday Sheikh Zaid also decided to pay all the prisoners' debts. It did not give details on the prisoners' offences.</p>
</text>
